Package: idle-shutdown-guard
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Codex <codex@example.invalid>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, systemd, zenity
Recommends: xprintidle
Description: User-session idle shutdown guard
 Small user-session service that watches desktop idle time after a configured
 hour, warns the user, allows postponing shutdown, and powers off the computer
 when the warning is ignored. It can also show a tray icon with a settings form.
